{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06644","headline":"酬李壶关奉使行县忆诸公 · 储光羲","name":"酬李壶关奉使行县忆诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青枫江上沧浪吟，白月宫中鹦鹉林。\n非有净清心，同道同房若断金。\n离居忽有云山意，清韵遥转舟檝事。\n去时能忆竹园游，来时莫忘桃园记。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}